### ========================================
### CALLBACK API TESTS
### PPPoE Connection Callbacks
### No Authentication Required (Called by MikroTik)
### ========================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### ========================================
### 1. PPPOE CONNECTION UP CALLBACK
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/callbacks/pppoe/up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "customer01",
  "caller_id": "00:11:22:33:44:55",
  "interface": "pppoe-customer01",
  "local_address": "10.10.10.1",
  "remote_address": "10.10.10.100",
  "service": "pppoe"
}

### This will:
### - Find customer by service_username
### - Update assigned_ip dan last_online
### - Set status = "active" jika inactive
### - Publish event ke Redis untuk real-time updates

### ========================================
### 2. PPPOE CONNECTION DOWN CALLBACK
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/callbacks/pppoe/down
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "customer01",
  "caller_id": "00:11:22:33:44:55",
  "interface": "pppoe-customer01",
  "local_address": "10.10.10.1",
  "remote_address": "10.10.10.100",
  "service": "pppoe"
}

### This will:
### - Find customer by service_username
### - Update last_ip
### - Clear assigned_ip
### - Publish event ke Redis

### ========================================
### TEST SCENARIOS
### ========================================

### Scenario: Customer connects
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/callbacks/pppoe/up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "testuser01",
  "caller_id": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF",
  "interface": "pppoe-testuser01",
  "local_address": "10.10.10.1",
  "remote_address": "10.10.10.150",
  "service": "pppoe"
}

### Scenario: Customer disconnects
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/callbacks/pppoe/down
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "testuser01",
  "caller_id": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF",
  "interface": "pppoe-testuser01",
  "local_address": "10.10.10.1",
  "remote_address": "10.10.10.150",
  "service": "pppoe"
}

### ========================================
### ERROR CASES
### ========================================

### Callback for non-existent customer (Should Log Warning)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/callbacks/pppoe/up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "nonexistent",
  "caller_id": "FF:FF:FF:FF:FF:FF",
  "interface": "pppoe-nonexistent",
  "local_address": "10.10.10.1",
  "remote_address": "10.10.10.200",
  "service": "pppoe"
}

### Callback with missing fields (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/callbacks/pppoe/up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "incomplete"
}

### ========================================
### MIKROTIK SCRIPT CONFIGURATION
### ========================================

### Add ini ke PPP Profile di MikroTik:
### on-up:
# :local baseUrl "http://your-api-server:8000/v1/callbacks/pppoe"
# /tool fetch url="$baseUrl/up" mode=http http-method=post \
#   http-data="{\"name\":\"$user\",\"caller_id\":\"$caller-id\",\"interface\":\"$interface\",\"local_address\":\"$local-address\",\"remote_address\":\"$remote-address\",\"service\":\"pppoe\"}" \
#   http-header-field="Content-Type: application/json"

### on-down:
# :local baseUrl "http://your-api-server:8000/v1/callbacks/pppoe"
# /tool fetch url="$baseUrl/down" mode=http http-method=post \
#   http-data="{\"name\":\"$user\",\"caller_id\":\"$caller-id\",\"interface\":\"$interface\",\"local_address\":\"$local-address\",\"remote_address\":\"$remote-address\",\"service\":\"pppoe\"}" \
#   http-header-field="Content-Type: application/json"
